  npcName: Yangban
  foodRequestProbability: 0.7
  medicineRequestProbability: 0.3
  reRequestChance: 0.5
  foodRequestLines:
  - I expect a decent meal. Surely you know your duty.
  medicineRequestLines:
  - See that a proper remedy is set aside for me.
  foodAcceptLines:
  - Sensible choice. Yangban should not be kept hungry after all.
  medicineAcceptLines:
  - I knew you'd recognize the importance of my condition.
  foodRejectLines:
  - Mind your manners. It's hardly proper toward your betters.
  medicineRejectLines:
  - I suppose some folk forget their place.
  foodReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  medicineReRequestLines:
  - Please...
  foodReAcceptLines:
  - Tardy but acceptable. Yangban won't nitpick.
  medicineReAcceptLines:
  - Finally. I trust you won't make me ask a third time.
  foodReRejectLines:
  - So you persist-Very well. I'll remember this discourtesy.
  medicineReRejectLines:
  - So even a second request is denied. Quite ungracious of you.
